Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,9:59:59.00,Header,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000E6FF&}DESERT BUTCHER{\c&H00FFFFFF&}  |  SHRIKE BIRD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:09.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THE SPINES IN THIS DESERT PROVIDE
{\c&H0000E6FF&}PROTECTION AND SHELTER{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,SO WHY SHOULD THESE SPIKES BE
{\c&H0000E6FF&}HUNG WITH CORPSES{\c&H00FFFFFF&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:26.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WHAT KIND OF CREATURE CREATED
SUCH A {\c&H0000E6FF&}GRUESOME SCENE{\c&H00FFFFFF&}?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:32.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THERE'S A {\c&H0000E6FF&}MYSTERIOUS KILLER{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
AT WORK IN THIS DESERT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:36.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,IT'S A {\c&H0000E6FF&}BUTCHER BIRD (SHRIKE){\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THIS SONGBIRD USES SPINES LIKE A BUTCHER'S HOOK
TO {\c&H0000E6FF&}DISMEMBER ITS PREY{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:54.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,WITH CHICKS TO FEED, HE ALSO USES
THE SPINES AS A {\c&H0000E6FF&}LADDER{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HANGING PREY OUT OF REACH OF SCAVENGERS
ENSURES HIS YOUNG {\c&H0000E6FF&}NEVER GO HUNGRY{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:18.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,AN INGENIOUS SOLUTION TO MAKE
THE {\c&H0000E6FF&}GOOD TIMES LAST{\c&H00FFFFFF&} IN THE DESERT.
